# Thieves Guild: joining, then Sugar-Lips Habasi's jobs, South Wall Cornerclub, Balmora (Habasi = 05B9FAAA).
# Joining asks rank 0's Agility and Personality 30 (MorrowindRuntime's FACT table: attributes 3, 6); the Set* lines
# stand in for level-up choices, made once here at the Mastermind requirement (34/34; best guild skill 80, second
# 30 -- OpenMW hasSkillsForRank) so later promotions hinge on the faction reputation the jobs earn. Each job is offered under "jobs" in a fixed order (diamond, Nerano Manor,
# Dwemer artifacts, Vintage Brandy, New-Shoes Bragor, South Wall) and learned from its words.
# AddItem stands in for the thefts (Nalcarya's diamond, the Nerano Manor key, Ra'Zhid's artifacts, Mebestien's
# coherer); the brandy leaves the drawer the job put it in. PositionCell + `approach` stand in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tg_join
run
player->SetAgility 34
player->SetPersonality 34
player->SetSecurity 80
player->SetSneak 30
player->PositionCell -242 650 9 0 "Balmora, South Wall Cornerclub"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, South Wall Cornerclub" == 1
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask join the Thieves Guild
choose 1
expect player->GetPCRank "Thieves Guild" >= 0
bye
end

case tg_diamond
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask jobs
ask diamond
expect GetJournalIndex TG_Diamonds == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem Ingred_Diamond_01 1
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask diamond
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_Diamonds == 100
bye
end

case tg_manor_key
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask jobs
ask Nerano Manor
expect GetJournalIndex TG_ManorKey == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem key_neranomanor 1
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask Nerano Manor
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_ManorKey == 100
bye
end

case tg_overdue_payments
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask jobs
ask Dwemer artifacts
expect GetJournalIndex TG_OverduePayments == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem misc_dwrv_artifact60 1
player->AddItem misc_dwrv_bowl00 1
player->AddItem misc_dwrv_goblet00 1
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask Dwemer artifacts
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_OverduePayments == 100
bye
end

case tg_vintage_brandy
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask jobs
ask Vintage Brandy
expect GetJournalIndex TG_VintageBrandy == 10
bye
run
"de_r_drawers_01_hlaalo"->RemoveItem p_vintagecomberrybrandy1 1
player->AddItem p_vintagecomberrybrandy1 1
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask Vintage Brandy
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_VintageBrandy == 100
bye
end

case tg_brother_bragor
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask jobs
ask New-Shoes Bragor
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BrotherBragor == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem misc_dwrv_artifact50 1
player->PositionCell 2191 100 136 0 "Pelagiad, Fort Pelagiad"
until 300 GetPCCell "Pelagiad, Fort Pelagiad" == 1
approach 05EF6FC0
talk shadbak gra-burbug
ask New-Shoes Bragor
choose 4
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BrotherBragor == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell -242 650 9 0 "Balmora, South Wall Cornerclub"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, South Wall Cornerclub" == 1
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask New-Shoes Bragor
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BrotherBragor == 100
bye
end

case tg_south_wall
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask jobs
ask South Wall
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BalmoraDefenses == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell -195 380 12 0 "Balmora, Hecerinde's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Hecerinde's House" == 1
approach 05C1B4B8
talk hecerinde
ask South Wall
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BalmoraDefenses == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell -242 650 9 0 "Balmora, South Wall Cornerclub"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, South Wall Cornerclub" == 1
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask South Wall
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BalmoraDefenses == 100
bye
end

# Six jobs' reputation (ModPCFacRep 5 each: 30) meets rank 4 (Operative: reputation 30); Habasi, a rank 8
# speaker, promotes one rank per "Advancement".
case tg_habasi_advancement
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank "Thieves Guild" == 4
bye
end
